<tr style=\"height: 248px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 248px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Rajasthan State Eligibility Test (SET)</span></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Conducted By : University of Kota Rajasthan</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan SET 2026 |</b></span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b> Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%; text-align: center; height: 224px;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Application Begin : <strong>14/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>15/07/2026</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <b>15/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Exam Date : <strong>06/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Admit Card Available : <b>Before Exam</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; text-align: center; height: 224px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">General / Other State : <b>1500/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">EWS / SBC / OBC : <strong>1</strong><b>200/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">SC / ST / PH : <strong>750/-</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Fee Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET </b></span><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Notification 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit Details</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No Upper Age Limit in Rajasthan SET 2026 Examination.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET Exam 2026 :&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Eligibility Details</span></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 26.4017%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.43489%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Rajasthan SET Subjects Details</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 31.5577%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET Eligibility Details</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">Chemical Sciences. Commerce, Computer Science and Application, Earth Science, Economics, Education, English, Environmental Science, Geography, Hindi, History, Home Science, Law, Life Science and Biotechnology, Management, Mathematical Science, Music, Philosophy, Physical Education, Physical Science, Population Study, Psychology and Public Administration</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Master’s Degree in the Relevant Subject with 55% Marks from any Recognized University in India.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">More Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Online Form 2026</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>University of Kota, Rajasthan has Released the Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET Online Form 2026 Notification. Candidate Can Apply Between <b>14 June 2026 to 15 July 2026.<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET Online 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and College the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px;\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 104px; width: 34.8366%;\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 31.5577%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"Apply Online\" href=\"https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/signin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><str