style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>15 July 2026..</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">15 July 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_23611\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23611\" style=\"width: 1495px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23611\" title=\"Rajasthan SET 2026\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201505%20995'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Rajasthan State Eligibility Test SET Online Form\" width=\"1505\" height=\"995\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Rajasthan-State-Eligibility-Test-SET.jpg 1505w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Rajasthan-State-Eligibility-Test-SET-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Rajasthan-State-Eligibility-Test-SET-1024x677.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Rajasthan-State-Eligibility-Test-SET-768x508.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-w